      "family_id": "family:4c59dcf7ccee98a5050ed42358c17ffa2281af1a",
      "title": "Direct air capture reactor systems and related methods of transporting carbon dioxide",
      "patent_id": "US20240252980A1",
      "abstract": "AbstractA direct air capture (DAC) reactor system is disclosed and comprises electrochemical cells. One or more of the electrochemical cells comprises a cathode, an anode, and an electrolyte membrane between the cathode and the anode. The electrolyte membrane is configured to transport carbonate ions and oxygenate ions from the cathode to the anode. Additional DAC reactor systems and methods of capturing carbon dioxide from a feedstream using the reactor systems are also disclosed.",
